OL,3,GNEWSAPizza boss jailed over #150,000
OL,4,ACovid loans fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pizza shop boss who fraudulently
OL,7,Fobtained three Covid Bounce Back Loans,
OL,8,Ftotalling #150,000, and spent a
OL,9,Fproportion of the funds on gambling and
OL,10,Fchildren's toys has been jailed for two
OL,11,Fyears.
OL,13,FMatthew Temple - known as Mehdi
OL,14,FGhaneh-Keisami when the offences were
OL,15,Fcommitted in 2020 - secured three
OL,16,Fgovernment-backed loans with a little
OL,17,Fmore than a month, the Insolvency
OL,18,FService said.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
