OL,3,GNEWSAPizza boss jailed over #150,000
OL,4,ACovid loans fraud
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 44-year-old, of Bank Court, North
OL,7,FShields, declared he would use the
OL,8,Fmoney to support Pizza Cottage (Whitley
OL,9,FBay) Limited, which traded as Pizza
OL,10,FCottage on East Parade in Whitley Bay.
OL,12,FHe was sentenced at Newcastle Crown
OL,13,FCourt on Friday, having pleaded guilty
OL,14,Fto three counts of fraud at an earlier
OL,15,Fhearing.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
